      },
      "message": "docs(process): add the yellow needs-maintainer review label\n\nA \"Not built - needs a maintainer look\" review (a new dependency, or a\nbuild.rs / scripts / .github change the reviewer reads and does not build)\nhad no label of its own, so such a PR looked unreviewed on the PR list.\nThe review-prs skill's label table, the PR-reviewer verdict line, the\nREADME contributing table and AGENTS.md's review-label sentence now name\nneeds-maintainer (yellow): reviewed with no blockers, waiting for the\nowner's decision.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
