      "message": "docs(process): every other label rule clears needs-maintainer\n\nReview of #459: only the yellow rule set or cleared needs-maintainer, so a\nPR could carry it next to merge-ready or needs-rework. The green, orange and\nred rules now remove it, and the yellow rule removes needs-rework.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
